menu "BLE Sniffer"

config BLE_CONN_ENABLED
    bool "Enable optional BLE connection feature (GATT client, F2.4)"
    default y
    depends on BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED
    select BT_NIMBLE_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
        Adds the central-role connection feature: connect to one peer by
        advertised service UUID (auto-connect) or direct address, subscribe
        a notify/indicate characteristic (poll fallback), and re-stream the
        payloads as "src":"conn" JSON lines on the same USB stream.

        Disabled: ble_conn.c is excluded from the build, the CONN commands
        answer -451, and firmware behavior is byte-identical to the
        feature-less product.

endmenu
